("h2", "3.12. Environmental impact"),
("p", "Table §T:env§ summarises the environmental indicators: Quantum’s declared water demand lies in a canton with drinking-water deficits and flood-prone land, Palo Negro adds generation land in an area with a history of aquifer contamination, and the network needs make-up water for its fish farms but no new substations; rejecting heat to rivers is avoided by design (Supplementary notes)."),
